      "text": "Set mms.featureFlag.backup.d2s3 to controlled for project-level opt-in, then activate Settings > Beta Features > Backup D2s3 in the project. (low confidence) (verified as of 2026-10-14)",
      "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/ops-manager/current/core/backup-direct-to-s3.md",
