      "text": "After project activation, new eligible backup jobs use Direct to S3 from their first snapshot without per-job opt-in. (medium confidence) (verified as of 2026-10-14)",
      "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/ops-manager/current/core/backup-direct-to-s3.md",
      "also": [
