      "text": "Backup jobs that existed before feature activation keep their existing Direct to S3 setting; activation does not automatically change those jobs. (low confidence) (verified as of 2026-10-14)",
      "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/ops-manager/current/core/backup-direct-to-s3.md",
      "also": [],
