      "text": "The per-job Direct S3 Backup control appears only for jobs whose snapshot store is an S3 blockstore. (medium confidence) (verified as of 2026-10-14)",
      "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/ops-manager/current/core/backup-direct-to-s3.md",
