    {
      "id": "clm:b45e7b54304a9e85e5a57665043a8caeba99472205be0a1c0484b9c021d42fc6",
      "text": "The MongoDB Agent freezes the upload path for a job. A snapshot already in progress completes on its original upload path; the documentation does not specify the effective boundary for every later manual toggle or flag revocation. (low confidence) (verified as of 2026-10-14)",
